8.<lb/>
Act. <hi rendition="#aq">X.</hi> 15.</note><hi rendition="#fr">Seelig &#x017F;ind die reines Herzens &#x017F;ind; Denn &#x017F;ie<lb/>
werden Gott an&#x017F;chauen. &#x2014; Und: Was Gott<lb/>
